    "body": "## Background\n\nThe scheduled failure notification added in #6503 should use the `public` GitHub environment to resolve its Slack webhook.\n\n## What changed\n\nSet `notify-nightly-failure.environment` to `public` in `.github/workflows/cicd-main.yml`.\n\n## Tested\n\n- `gh secret list --repo NVIDIA-NeMo/Megatron-Bridge --env public`: confirmed `SLACK_WEBHOOK` is defined. Environment metadata reports no protection rules or deployment branch restrictions.\n- `uv run --no-project --with pre-commit pre-commit run --all-files`: all applicable hooks passed.\n- Parsed YAML comparison against `origin/main`: the notification job's environment is the only configuration change.\n- Actionlint comparison against `origin/main`: identical existing diagnostics; no new findings.\n- `git diff --check`: passed.\n\nThese checks validate configuration; live Slack delivery remains unverified.\n",
    "changed_files": 1,
